# Images downloaded by src/media-cache.js during a crawl, so a provider whose
# links expire (pratikdani's TikTok Shop proxy answered 200 one day and 403
# three days later) still has a viewable picture. Runtime output that grows
# with every crawl — a cache, not source.
public/media/
